<title>LATVIA: OLAINE PEAT REGISTERS SHARES AT DEPOSITORY.</title>
<headline>OLAINE PEAT REGISTERS SHARES AT DEPOSITORY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository said on Thursday that it has registered an issue of 1.19 million shares with a nominal value of one lat in Olaine Peat.</p>
<p>Registering the shares at the depository is one of the most imporant steps in getting a bourse listing.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
